{"uid":"2e47f234b2e6de7c","name":"test_enable_tls_in_shard_using_rolling_ops","fullName":"tests.integration.mongodb.test_sharding_rollingops#test_enable_tls_in_shard_using_rolling_ops","historyId":"5b647c570cd801e63026f5e9559ea834","time":{},"description":"Enable TLS for shard components and verify rolling ops etcd lock acquisition.\n\n    Integrates TLS certificates for all cluster components and verifies that\n    the rolling ops worker successfully acquires a distributed lock via etcd lease.\n    Parses the worker log file to confirm \"Lock granted using lease\" entry exists\n    with a timestamp after TLS enablement began.\n\n    Log entry format example:\n        2026-05-21 13:36:24,692 [INFO] [77172]\n        [unit=config-server4/0 cluster=7sSW9jUx\n         owner=53a5e2f6-7c0e-4017-8a36-c61093fa17ab-config-server4-0]\n        __main__: Lock granted using lease 278b9e4abfac811b.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Enable TLS for shard components and verify rolling ops etcd lock acquisition.</p>\n<pre><code>Integrates TLS certificates for all cluster components and verifies that\nthe rolling ops worker successfully acquires a distributed lock via etcd lease.\nParses the worker log file to confirm &quot;Lock granted using lease&quot; entry exists\nwith a timestamp after TLS enablement began.\n\nLog entry format example:\n    2026-05-21 13:36:24,692 [INFO] [77172]\n    [unit=config-server4/0 cluster=7sSW9jUx\n     owner=53a5e2f6-7c0e-4017-8a36-c61093fa17ab-config-server4-0]\n    __main__: Lock granted using lease 278b9e4abfac811b.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"unknown","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"afterStages":[],"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"abort_on_fail"},{"name":"tag","value":"asyncio"},{"name":"tag","value":"asyncio"},{"name":"parentSuite","value":"tests.integration.mongodb"},{"name":"suite","value":"test_sharding_rollingops"},{"name":"host","value":"runnervmmklq